    "method": "Joint GNSS and ascending/descending Sentinel-1 InSAR inversion. Uniform-fault nonlinear inversion followed by nonnegative least squares spatially distributed-slip inversion with smoothing; this JSON approximates Figure 8 using the six published slip intervals.",
